#! The floor of the protocol. A client that declares nothing optional must
#! still get a usable server: the capability set is asserted `subset`, so the
#! server gaining a capability leaves this green and losing one turns it red.
#! `positionEncoding` must come back utf-16 — the mandatory default for a
#! client that offered nothing.
name      lifecycle/initialize-minimal
profile   minimal

initialize
shutdown
